e current time is set to 0 seconds.\n      TC0028: To verify that the user agent correctly handles an invalid media fragment and plays the entire media resource.\n      TC0029: To verify that the user agent correctly handles an invalid media fragment and plays the entire media resource, starting at currentTime == 0.\n      TC0030: To verify that the user agent correctly handles an invalid media fragment and plays the entire media resource, starting at currentTime == 0.\n      TC0031: To verify that the user agent correctly handles an invalid media fragment and plays the entire media resource, starting at currentTime == 0.\n      TC0032: To verify that the user agent correctly handles an invalid media fragment and plays the entire media resource, starting at currentTime == 0.\n      TC0033: To verify that the user agent correctly handles an invalid media fragment with multiple values and plays the entire media resource, starting at currentTime == 0.\n    ','High','M143','testscriptsRDKV/component/webkit',_binary '\0','','\n    TC0027: To ensure that when an invalid media fragment (\'t=banana\') is requested, the user agent plays the entire media resource instead of attempting to play a fragment.\n    TC0028: To ensure that when an invalid media fragment (\'t=3,banana\') is requested, the user agent plays the entire media resource from the start.\n    TC0029: To ensure that when an invalid media fragment (\'t=banana,7\') is requested, the user agent plays the entire media resource from the start.\n    TC0030: To ensure that when an invalid media fragment (\'t=\'3\'\') is requested, the user agent plays the entire media resource from the start.\n    TC0031: To ensure that when an invalid media fragment (\'t=3-7\') is requested, the user agent plays the entire media resource from the start.\n    TC0032: To ensure that when an invalid media fragment (\'t=3:7\') is requested, the user agent plays the entire media resource from the start.\n    TC0033: To ensure that when a