, only the last occurrence of t=3 is used, and the video starts playing from 3 seconds.\n      TC0058: To ensure that when a media fragment with an unrecognized fragment identifier (\'T=3,7\') is given, the user agent (UA) does not treat it as a valid media fragment and instead plays the entire media resource from the start.\n      TC0059: To verify that if a media fragment contains multiple time dimensions (e.g., \'t=smpte:00:00:01\' and \'t=npt:3\'), the user agent (UA) correctly interprets and uses only the last specified time dimension (\'t=npt:3\') for playback.\n    ','High','M143','testscriptsRDKV/component/webkit',_binary '\0','','\n    TC0055: To verify that when multiple occurrences of a fragment dimension are provided, only the last occurrence is interpreted.\n    TC0058: To verify that when an invalid media fragment is provided, the entire media resource is played.\n    TC0059: To ensure that when multiple fragment dimensions are provided, only the last one is interpreted.\n  ','Mediafragments_07','401d2467-97b0-43f7-aba0-7e8604ed5a87','2132fb29-69db-4a8c-a079-44a344d6a63e',NULL),('5445ac59-8b26-485c-b214-6c429f4036d9','2025-10-07 13:26:02.287837','2025-10-07 13:26:02.287837','RDKB',30,_binary '\0','TS_ONEWIFI_CheckTelemetryMarkerWith5GhzBytesSentAndReceived','This test case is to check if the bytes sent and received via TR-181 and telemetry marker are greater than zero by changing the log interval to 5 min','High','M78','testscriptsRDKB/component/OneWifi',_binary '\0',NULL,'Check if bytes sent and received via TR-181 and telemetry marker are greater than zero by Changing the Log Interval.','TC_ONEWIFI_105','abefc226-9b25-4a4b-a862-5a8d416b597a','ea3ed5c3-285c-421a-8664-b7ca5d275d24',NULL),('5459ec0f-6e6c-43d3-9ee4-df0769c2af30','2025-10-07 13:26:55.452199','2025-10-07 13:26:55.452199','RDKB',2,_binary '\0','TS_PAM_SetDHCPServerIPBeyondPrivateAddressRange','This test case will check whether setting the DHCP server IP beyond the allowed private address range is not allowed','High','','testscriptsRDKB/component/PAM',_binary '\0',NULL,'This test case will check whether setting the DHCP server IP beyond the allowed private address range is not allowed','TC_PAM_177','5997d1e0-8079-45a8-bb0b-5e99d17d9d43','cb088ff4-7e60-4828-bf28-03bf7b47b75b',NULL),('547f23e5-a2a8-4137-b2a3-42b3f66f8cd9','2025-11-17 10:15:56.469048','2025-11-17 10:15:56.469052','RDKB',15,_binary '\0','E2E_ParentalControl_ManagedServices_6GHZ_Block_FTP_ForGivenTime','Verify that gateway supports blocking of FTP service for Wi-Fi Client associated using 6GHZ radio only during specific day and time period through parental control (managed services)','High','M143','testscriptsRDKB/integration/TDKB_E2E',_binary '\0','','Verify that gateway supports blocking of FTP service for Wi-Fi Client associated using 6GHZ radio only during specific day and time period through parental control (managed services)','TC_TDKB_E2E_722','1daf175e-2d23-4b6f-ab57-2d67cb2eaa9e','3c61bc2b-1bf3-489a-bfd2-f54f081eff4f',NULL),('54828f73-68ea-4b49-a933-ef8089844e15','2025-12-03 02:35:11.423439','2025-12-03 02:35:11.423439','RDKV',30,_binary '\0','RDKV_Webkit_MediaFragments_URLEncodedFragment','\n      TC0034: To ensure that when a media fragment is URL-encoded (\'t%3D3\'), the user agent does not treat it as a valid fragment and instead plays the entire media resource starting from the beginning (currentTime == 0).\n      TC0035: To ensure that when a URL-encoded fragment (\'%74=3\', which is equivalent to \'t=3\') is used, the media is requested to play starting from 3 seconds and ending at the end of the media resource.\n      TC0036: To ensure that when a URL-encoded fragment (\'t=%33\', which is equivalent to \'t=3\') is used, the media is requested to play starting from 3 seconds and ending at the end of the media resource.\n      TC0037: To ensure that when a URL-encoded fragment (\'t=3%2C7\', which is equivalent to \'t=3,7\') is used, the media plays from 3 seconds to 7 seconds.\n      TC0038: To ensure that the URL-encoded fragment \'t=%6Ept:3\', which translates to \'t=npt:3\', correctly requests playback starting from 3 seconds to the end of the media resource.\n      TC0039: To ensure that the URL-encoded fragment \'t=npt%3A3\', which translates to \'t=npt:3\', correctly requests playback starting from 3 seconds to the end of the media resource.\n    ','High','M143','testscriptsRDKV/component/webkit',_binary '\0','','\n    TC0034: To verify that a URL-encoded fragment (\'t%3D3\') is not recognized as a valid media fragment and the user agent plays the entire media resource from the start.\n    TC0035: To verify that a URL-encoded fragment (\'%74=3\') is correctly interpreted as a valid media fragment and that the media plays from 3 seconds to the end.\n    TC0036: To verify that a URL-encoded fragment (\'t=%33\') is correctly interpreted as a valid media fragment and that the media plays from 3 seconds to the end.\n    TC0037: To verify that a URL-encoded fragment (\'t=3%2C7\') is correctly interpreted as a valid media fragment requesting playback from 3 to 7 seconds.\n    TC0038: To verify that a URL-encoded fragment (\'t=%6Ept:3\') is correctly interpreted and the media is requested from 3 seconds to the end, where %6E is equivalent to n.\n    TC0039: To verify that a URL-encoded fragment (\'t=npt%3A3\') is correctly interpreted and the media is requested from 3 seconds to the end.\n  ','Mediafragments_13','401d2467-97b0-43f7-aba0-7e8604ed5a87','2132fb29-69db-4a8c-a079-44a344d6a63e',NULL),('54865059-f09f-496a-809f-a42dc3996db8','2025-10-07 13:11:30.589679','2025-10-07 13:11:30.589679','RDKV_RDKSERVICE',15,_binary '\0','RDKV_CERT_AVS_RemoteControl','None','HIGH','','testscriptsRDKV/component/rdkservices',_binary '\0',NULL,'To Test RDKService RemoteControl APIs','None','ac3c1912-0579-4bdd-9ede-5161b2dc757e','755d3ca6-6bc1-45b5-a183-2eb98203cc8f',NULL),('54888082-2125-4bfd-99b3-88895fcdda63','2026-03-27 11:50:28.927840','2026-03-27 11: