ctly as #t=3, and the media starts playing from 3 seconds without any errors.\n      TC0052: To ensure that when the media fragment \'u=12ampersandt=3\' is provided, it is processed correctly and the video starts playing from 3 seconds, ignoring the irrelevant u parameter.\n    ','High','M143','testscriptsRDKV/component/webkit',_binary '\0','','\n    TC0024: To verify that a media fragment request with a non-parameterized time (\'t=npt:3,7\') is correctly interpreted as a request from time 3 to 7.\n    TC0051: To verify that a media fragment with an extra ampersand character (e.g., \'t=3ampersand\') is treated as equivalent to #t=3 and the media plays from the specified time.\n    TC0052: To verify that a media fragment with additional parameters (e.g., \'u=12ampersandt=3\') is correctly interpreted as #t=3 and the media plays from the specified time.\n  ','Mediafragments_10','401d2467-97b0-43f7-aba0-7e8604ed5a87','2132fb29-69db-4a8c-a079-44a344d6a63e',NULL),('e0b85237-4f79-48fe-ae45-e8ae07154e0a','2025-10-07 13:27:52.277276','2025-10-07 13:27:52.277276','RDKB',1,_binary '\0','TS_SANITY_Is_lanclient_interfaces_Up','Get the interface names corresponding to the bridges brlan0 and brlan1 from brctl show output. Check whether these interfaces are up or not','High','','testscriptsRDKB/component/sysutil',_binary '\0',NULL,'Get the interface names corresponding to the bridges brlan0 and brlan1 from brctl show output. Check whether these interfaces are up or not','TC_SYSUTIL_4','b8ca48cc-acf6-4ee1-a301-a27508320f9a','8837062a-8d32-4895-87c7-3b210b18b924',NULL),('e0c091ec-9615-40b3-9505-f2d8c630e2d8','2025-10-07 13:24:37.104903','2025-10-07 13:24:37.104903','RDKB',15,_binary '\0','TS_ETHAGENT_CheckAssociatedDeviceNumberOfEntries','To check if lan client connected interface AssociatedDeviceNumberOfEntries\nshould return the number of  client connected to that ethernet port','High','M68','testscriptsRDKB/component/ETHAGENT',_binary '\0',NULL,'To check if lan client connected i