-bd03-4dc0-80c4-d67f589b6f98'),('00aef7c9-d3f1-4d99-bb1c-4b04c0924d0a','2025-10-07 13:25:43.560005','2025-10-07 13:25:43.560005','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','a252457d-c3eb-4047-9782-57565f025f96'),('00b9a04f-847f-43fd-a982-bf46c05f166a','2025-10-07 13:13:53.631615','2025-10-07 13:13:53.631615','The device must be online with wpeframework service running.\nAll the variables in WebkitVariables.py must be filled.','e70c13a5-518b-4311-9c11-91716d86d858'),('00bd674f-bcb8-4174-b604-427ab9a15da6','2025-10-07 13:15:15.731037','2025-10-07 13:15:15.731037','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application must be installed in DUT\n2. Test stream url for an H264_60Fps stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_dash_h264_60fps inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time to wait before checking for AV playback','5568bccf-4f4a-44d2-b6f0-a0872a7b8ae1'),('00c362bd-1bd7-4af4-bf7b-b0aebe31e0c0','2025-10-07 13:28:22.388911','2025-10-07 13:28:22.388911','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state of DUT\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','a22f13cf-25d4-4af8-80f1-baea27c4ffd5'),('00ca95e5-07e6-4659-8244-bbe57a07db06','2025-10-07 13:24:28.990776','2025-10-07 13:24:28.990776','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components.\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script\n','d35db2a5-4135-4cfc-a417-b18fbc34f38e'),('00cddbc5-afa1-4719-a361-2767b15af842','2025-12-19 10:25:38.665870','2025-12-19 10:25:38.665874','Wpeframework process should be