pt','05ba8a81-72f4-4d57-b7ec-eb616f5b6865'),('65135e9c-8423-4786-b99d-3e47945050a6','2025-10-07 13:29:16.609265','2025-10-07 13:29:16.609265','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state of DUT\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','244dc710-3fb3-41d7-a653-fac7a8152db2'),('6523c4ad-4a4e-4522-8e2b-ebd7300b96de','2025-10-07 13:45:43.107908','2025-10-07 13:45:43.107908','1.Ccsp Components in DUT should be in a running state that includes component under test Cable Modem\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','ce4dfca3-d48c-4a96-b319-228557d05e7c'),('652bc65a-673c-4221-9a44-1f1f94bc2125','2025-10-07 13:17:00.327992','2025-10-07 13:17:00.327992','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n2.Lightning Player app should be hosted','c852b3cd-f46d-4d4f-80a9-2ad4d9545fb0'),('65331331-e4e5-4c0d-a0c9-9e3be2c7fa49','2025-10-07 13:16:05.320670','2025-10-07 13:16:05.320670','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests_trickplay application must be installed in DUT\n2. Test stream url for a H264 stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_dash_h264_24fps inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time in seconds for which the fastforward operation should be carried out\n5. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_SEEK_POSITION configuration should be set to duration in seconds to which the seek operation should be carried out\n6. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_VALIDATE_FULL_PLAYBACK configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for advanced playback validation\n7. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_PTS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating video pts\n8. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_FPS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating video frames\n9. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_AUDIO configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating audio frames','b337b950-39e0-4162-b046-4d6b5c4975c5'),('6533d0dc-cadb-4714-b6a1-64377c22ea5c','2025-10-07 13:19:41.277282','2025-10-07 13:19:41.277282','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device. \n2.Lightning Player app should be hosted.\n3.Streaming server should be up and running in the docker.','28ba8579-6df7-4a04-8225-000afcd8f831'),('65341770-501f-42cf-b4d4-05e8f6293633','2025-12-03 02:35:11.426439','2025-12-03 02:35:11.426439','The device must be online with wpeframework service running.\nAll the variables in WebkitVariables.py must be filled.','54828f73-68ea-4b49-a933-ef8089844e15'),('653bb01d-5b29-45d3-b37c-256ce89a575a','2025-10-07 13:27:03.985374','2025-10-07 13:27:03.985374','TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','bf68e0e5-0475-42d3-8231-1bff92d2011b'),('653ea574-0dd8-461f-966e-438678fd5e2d','2025-10-07 13:24:58.909579','2025-10-07 13:24:58.909579','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state of DUT\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','3658d8c5-abf5-4570-a0b0-26c71349d519'),('6555977c-9a15-493c-8510-3c69c5b37c85','2025-10-07 13:24:13.239176','2025-10-07 13:24:13.239176','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state of DUT that includes component under test Cable Modem\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','f63b65e7-9626-4563-9cb0-8d58158018d2'),('6555f74f-c570-463c-a35c-e4d8ab01d7a0','2025-10-07 13:32:37.894338','2025-10-07 13:32:37.894338','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state of DUT that includes component under test Cable Modem\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','e9fa4871-eae0-407b-8607-95276f58e851'),('655d92f5-60bd-436d-9163-16a45b484701','2025-10-07 13:16:35.824537','2025-10-07 13:16:35.824537','1. Wpeframework pro